Incoterms: Exw Dubai UAE
Delivery: 10 weeks
All above prices are in USD
There will be a 50% order cancellation fee
There will be a 50% cancellation fee on all returned items
VAT @ 5% Not included &amp; to be added to the invoice
Warranty: 12 months
Payment Terms: 100% 45 days after Invoice</Value>
                                      <Style>
